1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,729 --> 00:00:10,720
Last time, we rode the
music alphabet lift.

3
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:19,178
Today we are going to listen
for higher, lower, or the same.

4
00:00:21,278 --> 00:00:24,133
Listen to these two notes.

5
00:00:26,033 --> 00:00:31,534
The second note sits higher on
the stave, so it sounds higher!

6
00:00:35,834 --> 00:00:40,128
This time it sits lower,
so it sounds lower.

7
00:00:44,428 --> 00:00:50,533
And if they sit in the very
same place, they sound the same!

8
00:00:54,833 --> 00:00:58,662
Even one tiny step up is still higher!

9
00:01:01,262 --> 00:01:04,488
Your turn! Look, and listen.

10
00:01:08,788 --> 00:01:10,110
Higher!

11
00:01:16,110 --> 00:01:17,431
The same!

12
00:01:23,431 --> 00:01:24,631
Lower!

13
00:01:25,167 --> 00:01:26,489
You've got it!

14
00:01:28,189 --> 00:01:29,650
Now it's your turn!

15
00:01:29,750 --> 00:01:34,926
Play Higher, Lower or Same, and
see how many you can get right!

16
00:01:35,026 --> 00:01:37,416
See you for the next Nugget!

